        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Works: The Lemon Drop Kid (1934 film)\n- People: Damon Runyon, Marshall Neilan, Howard J. Green, J.P. McEvoy\n- Topics: American film, writing, journalism\n\nFacts:\n- Alfred Damon Runyon was born on October 4, 1880.\n- Alfred Damon Runyon was an American newspaperman and short story writer.\n- The Lemon Drop Kid is a 1934 American comedy-drama film.\n- The Lemon Drop Kid was directed by Marshall Neilan.\n- The Lemon Drop Kid was written by Howard J. Green, J.P. McEvoy, and Damon Runyon.\n- Alfred Damon Runyon died on December 10, 1946.",
